glsl","commit_id":"0dfa4183c7dd15146dd4841b137e3b3930aaeb1c","original_commit_id":"923c6b298efc6d415b9535fcbcc69883eceff955","user":{"login":"neclor","id":81529592,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNTI5NTky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81529592?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor","html_url":"https://github.com/neclor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neclor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The thing is that before the fix, when `src_rect.zw` was negative, a flip was applied in the vertex shader - for regular rects this worked correctly since UV is also computed there. \r\nBut NinePatch computes UV in the fragment shader, and there is another flip at line 600. \r\nThese two flips cancelled each other out so NinePatch had no visual flip. \r\nThe fix removes the vertex shader flip for NinePatch, since line 600 in the fragment shader already handles it.","created_at":"2026-06-22T22:55:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T22:55:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#discussion_r3455945584","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120507","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3455945584"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120507#discussion_r3455945584"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repo